<aside class="research-callout" aria-label="FDD external research">
  <span class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT RESEARCH / DECEMBER 2022</span>
  <h3>FDD TCIL quantum-security research</h3>
  <p>Independent research conducted by FDD’s Transformative Cyber Innovation Lab with Cyber Reliant examined the Augmented Improbability of Access (AIA) approach to the quantum threat.</p>
  <p>The research concluded that U.S. government and private organizations should pursue AIA solutions.</p>
  <a class="text-link" href={source}>Read the FDD research <Arrow/></a>
  <p class="research-boundary">Research relates to the evaluated AIA approach and should not be interpreted as certification of every Cyber Reliant product implementation.</p>
</aside>
